Public domain
=============

The original map
----------------

付図第五「北支那方面軍占拠地域内治安概況（昭和十七年九月中）」, an appendix to
防衛庁防衛研修所戦史室 編『北支の治安戦＜2＞』(戦史叢書 第50巻, 東京: 朝雲新聞社,
1971). Scanned copy: https://www.nids.mod.go.jp/military_history_search/SoshoView?kanno=050

No copyright is claimed over this original map.

This website
------------

No copyright is claimed over this website — its code, its styling, or the
data files derived from the map. To the extent possible under law, it is
released into the public domain, and may be copied, modified, published,
used, taught from, sold, and redistributed by anyone, for any purpose,
with or without permission.

Attribution
-----------

Attribution is not a legal condition of use, but it is asked for as a
courtesy: the georeferencing and digitisation of the original map — tracing
the occupied territory, the resistance areas, the attacks and the
settlements into GIS layers — was done by Konrad M. Lawson. Please credit
that work if you build on it.

Suggested credit:

    Georeferencing and digitisation by Konrad M. Lawson, from 付図第五
    「北支那方面軍占拠地域内治安概況」, 戦史叢書 第50巻『北支の治安戦＜2＞』(1971).

The base maps are not covered by any of the above and carry their own terms:
OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL), CARTO, and Esri.
